  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "unspecified",
    "description": "Mia AI Lab's exact two-Spark TensorFold kit at 1afc8910: EAQ v1 EXL3 2.9 bpw checkpoint, full 1,048,576-token shared pool, four streams, DSpark drafts, image input, thinking on, and required/named tool-choice enforcement. Preserves all four upstream engine patches and enables its measured prompt-cache placement setting. Uses Mia's digest-pinned ARM64 image with its exact serving fork, auxiliary rank-cache tools and four patches, plus the pinned kernel kit. Controller-managed read-only models and local Engram shards replace upstream SSH/NFS setup; durable per-rank derived inputs use /outputs/cache. Estimated peak 115 GiB per Spark conservatively covers upstream's 98.9 GiB rank weights, 12.2 GiB runtime allowance and workspace. This is an estimate; physical qualification on this fleet is pending. The optional gated abliterated overlay is not included.",
